{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","安丹德拉"],["/names/en","Antandra"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名英勇的坦克，能够在作战的同时持续守护一名队友。"],["/description_i18n/en","A brave Tank to provide an ally sustained protection in a battle."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我为守护而来。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","I come to protect."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","坚持锻炼就会得到成长。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Keep training to keep growing."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","寓攻于守！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Good defense! And offense!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","还没到放弃的时候……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I can't... give up... now."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","欢呼吧，这是我们的胜利！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","This is our victory!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","为守护而进攻！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","I strike to defend!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","我是安丹德拉，一个被流放者。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Let's spar, and see who's the better warrior."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","为了守护大家，想试试吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","I have to protect everyone!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","你说这个，是收到的小礼物，很不错吧？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","This? It's a gift I got. Pretty nice, right?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这正是我喜欢的，谢谢你。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","This is exactly to my liking, thank you."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","送我的吗……让你破费了。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","For me? You shouldn't have troubled yourself."],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","流放之矛"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Desert Fury"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","为自己的信仰而战，不问代价与归处。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","Fight for your beliefs, and stop at nothing."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","金戈之舞"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Golden Whirl"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","金戈映日，裙摆翻飞，足尖叩响自由与热情的战歌。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","Dance to the song of freedom and passion, with your golden weapon reflecting the sun and the hem of your dress flapping in the wind."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","幻化商店购买获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Velvet Store"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Epic"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","最近过得如何？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","How's life treating you lately?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","家乡现在如何了呢……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","I wonder how things are in my hometown.."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要尝尝我烤的兔子吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Would you like a bite of the rabbit I roasted?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","变得更温馨了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","It's getting cozier by the minute."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","隆冬节要一起过吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Want to spend the Winter Carnival together?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","真是温暖又热闹啊"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","It's so warm and lively here."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","一起去外面走走吧？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Shall we take a stroll outside?"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","安丹德拉臂力过人，扳手腕很少输，即使对面是健壮的男性也一样。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Antandra possesses incredible arm strength and rarely loses arm-wrestling matches, even when her opponents are powerful males."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","据说，安丹德拉身上的金饰比旁人的沉重一些，是由前几任首席战士的遗物熔炼而成的。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","They say Antandra's golden accessories are even heavier than those usually worn by others, and that they were smelted from the relics of previous warriors."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","据说，安丹德拉在玩剪刀石头布时，每次都会先出石头。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","They say Antandra only chooses rock when playing rock-paper-scissors."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","据萨忒娜说，过去安丹德拉虽身为神庙战士，却不信占卜。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","According to Satrana, Antandra does not believe in divination despite serving as a Holy Temple warrior in the past."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","“在雇我们照顾孩子时，她出手可是相当阔绰。”赏金猎人们都很好奇安丹德拉从哪里变出那么多钱。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","\"When she hired us, she paid a fortune just to have us watch over a bunch of kids.\"—Bounty hunters who are still curious to know where Antandra found that much money."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","安丹德拉狩猎技术十分优秀，能猎取比自己大上数倍的野兽而毫发无伤。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Antandra's hunting skills are second-to-none. She is capable of taking down prey that is several times larger than herself, all without sustaining a single injury."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","据说安丹德拉的盾之所以如此坚固，是由于神庙的祝福。但被流放后的安丹德拉，依然可以毫不费力地抵御敌人的进攻。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Some claim that Antandra's shield owes its resilience to the Holy Temple's blessing. However, even after her expulsion, Antandra is still capable of fending off vicious attacks with ease."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","安丹德拉重视每一日的磨炼，对身边的孩童亦是如此要求，但她严格而不乏慈爱，所以仍然很受孩子们喜欢。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Antandra places a high value on daily training and expects the same from the children around her. Strict yet nurturing, she is quite popular among the children of her tribe."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","在萨忒娜的记忆中，安丹德拉总是温柔地笑着，她总是不能将传闻中那个强悍的战士和自己温柔体贴的好友联系起来。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","In Satrana's mind, Antandra is a kind and considerate friend who is always smiling. This makes it difficult for her to associate Antandra with the fierce warrior mentioned in local rumors."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","安丹德拉没有自己的孩子，但是有很多孩子将其视为母亲。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Antandra has no children of her own, but many children still see her as their mother."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","卡卡，看起来帕托和你相处很好呢，它凶不凶？"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Koko, you seem to get along with Patto. Is he aggressive?"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412070.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412070.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 卡卡 & 安丹德拉"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Koko & Antandra"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Eroded Enclave"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Crimson Highlands"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","我的过去……你会对这些感兴趣吗？<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>？"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","My past... Are you really interested, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412080.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412080.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","安丹德拉 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Antandra & Soren"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Eroded Enclave"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Crimson Highlands"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","索恩，坐下好好休息吧，已经走了一天，应该很疲劳了。"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Soren, take a seat. You've walked all day. Your body needs some rest."],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412120.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412120.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","安丹德拉 & 索恩 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Antandra & Soren & Satrana"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Eroded Enclave"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Crimson Highlands"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","安丹德拉为什么在休息时经常闭上眼睛？好像也没在睡觉……"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Antandra, why do you like to close your eyes when we rest? Chippy doesn't think you're sleeping..."],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412160.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412160.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 安丹德拉"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Antandra"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Eroded Enclave"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Crimson Highlands"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","最近过得如何？"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","How's life treating you lately?"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415088.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/1041508